#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: postvoyage-socialmedia-poster.php:3
msgid "PostVoyage - Free Social Media Post Distributor"
msgstr "PostVoyage - Free Social Media Post Distributor"

#. Description of the plugin
#: postvoyage-socialmedia-poster.php:4
msgid "Shares your posts automatically on Mastodon, Bluesky, Telegram, Discord, Facebook, Threads, LinkedIn, X and any webhook. Free, with rules per category and templates with variables."
msgstr "Teilt deine Beiträge automatisch auf Mastodon, Bluesky, Telegram, Discord, Facebook, Threads, LinkedIn, X und per Webhook. Kostenlos, mit Regeln je Kategorie und Vorlagen mit Variablen."

